{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はTGC初ランウェイを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANNA SUIさんのステージで踏ませて頂きましたっっっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/19/8857655/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滅多に出来ないことをするってこんなにドキドキして体が動かなくなるんですねっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前に袖でみんなにパワーもらってなんとか気持ちを落ち着かせて挑みました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルさんは桁違いの表現力と美しさでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんを起用して下さったANNA SUIさんの為にもランウェイ出た時だけは自分に自信を持ちました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場の黄色い声援を沢山もらいました(´；ω；｀)⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまちゃーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこたーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう声援が涙が出るほど嬉しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんほんとにありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、いう事で、本日ANNA SUIのビジュアルが解禁になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんぜひ見てくださいね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/19/8857655/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな生駒ちゃん今しか見れないよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/19/8857655/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでオリラジさんにご挨拶しました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/19/8857655/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/19/8857655/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永野さんにもご挨拶〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/19/8857655/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舌出してるみたいな苺大福"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/19/8857655/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあすかさん破壊的な可愛さ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/19/8857655/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/19/8857655/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいろんな事が初体験でしたヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の方に感謝です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}